# Heavy local video originals — all live copies are served from
# Cloudflare R2 (pub-0e689c2d21c04ec09ccaaeb008d32495.r2.dev).
# GitHub rejects single files > 100 MB; keep these out of the
# repo. The one local video the build actually references is
# whitelisted below.
/public/assets/videos/*.mp4
!/public/assets/videos/video-scroll-scrub.mp4
